  j/k, down/up           move
  tab                    switches
  /                      filter
  ?                      help
  q                      quit
  esc                    back
  right, enter           skills

 project skills
  i                      import
  j/k, down/up           move
  tab                    switches
  /                      filter
  ?                      help
  q                      quit
  esc                    back
  left                   projects
  space                  on/off
  enter                  on/off or review

 Tools
  tab                    switches
  t                      show skill cost per project
  n                      add an MCP server or a skill from a folder
  enter                  open the actions for the selected tool
  R                      rescan tool copies

 Settings
  tab, ]                 jump to the next section
  shift+tab, [           jump to the previous section
  enter                  open the selected setting: integrations, name this machine, or restart tips
  space                  toggle internet access, desktop notifications or tips
  p                      switch internet access in Connected apps
  u                      set the tunnel URL, or undo the selected setting revision
  a                      add a connected app
  x                      remove the selected machine or revoke the selected app
  g                      choose the shared MCP servers the selected bot may use
  n                      rename the selected app
  r                      rotate the selected online machine token

 Desk
  pgup/pgdn              page
  home/g, end            first, last row
  a                      approve the request
  r                      refuse the request
  s                      keep the refusal
  O                      grant the request
  A                      approve all changes
  t                      type answer
  x                      dismiss the ask
  i                      on a sign-in ask: open that CLI's login in a herdr pane on the machine that needs it
  w                      in the details of a question or approval: answer the marked option and keep it as a standing
                         rule. Type the action and its area: merge in repo:<name>, team:<name> or network. A rule
                         applies only on an exact match; undo it on its Log line.
  d                      on an open ask: talk it over. A chief item opens the chief's session and wakes it; a Atlas item
                         opens your Atlas chat.
  u                      undo
  n                      on an ask that reached you, open or answered (in Handled for you): the chief did not need to
                         send it. Type one optional line of why; the chief reads it in its next batch.
  m                      on a handled ask: the chief should have asked you. Type one optional line of why; the chief
                         reads it in its next batch.
  v                      show or hide the done and stale changes in the In flight section
  l                      open or close the Log section: what the Atlas and the gateway did, with the undo of a Atlas
                         change

 On a held request row
  a                      approve the request
  r                      refuse the request

 On a learned suggestion row
  a                      accept it
  r                      reject it

 On an outcome row
  s                      keep the refusal
  O                      grant the request

 On a Atlas proposal row
  enter                  open the proposal detail
  a                      approve the change
  r                      decline the change
  A                      approve all the changes

 On a change in flight
  pgup                   ten changes up
  pgdown                 ten changes down
  a                      show all
  y                      on a To try row, report that the check passed: the owner tried it and it works
  n                      on a To try row, report that the check failed: type one line of what is wrong

  in details             up and down choose an answer; enter answers the marked one; digits still switch tabs

